#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introdución"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&ksig; is a graphical tool for keeping track of many different email "
#| "signatures. The signatures themselves can be edited through &ksig;&apos;s "
#| "graphical user interface. A command-line interface is then available for "
#| "generating random or daily signatures from a list. The command-line "
#| "interface makes a suitable plugin for generating signatures in external "
#| "mail clients such as &kmail;."
msgid ""
"&ksig; is a graphical tool for keeping track of many different email "
"signatures. The signatures themselves can be edited through &ksig;&apos;s "
"graphical user interface. A command-line interface is then available for "
"generating random or daily signatures from a list. The command-line "
"interface makes a suitable plugin for generating signatures in external mail "
"clients such as &kmail; or any other client that can obtain the signature "
"text from the output of a command."
msgstr ""
"O &ksig; é unha ferramenta gráfica para controlar moitas sinaturas distintas "
"de correo electrónico. As sinaturas mesmas pódense modificar coa interface "
"gráfica de usuario &apos; do &ksig;. Tamén se dispón dunha interface para a "
"liña de comandos para xerar sinaturas ao chou ou diariamente a partir dunha "
"lista. A interface para a liña de comandos constitúe un engadido axeitado "
"para xerar sinaturas en clientes de correo externos como o &kmail;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Random signatures will pull signatures from the &ksig; signature file "
#| "randomly. You can make every email more exiciting and uniqe than the "
#| "previous by creating multiple signatures with varying quotes, styles, and "
#| "information."
msgid ""
"Random signatures will pull signatures from the &ksig; signature file "
"randomly. You can make every email more exiciting and unique than the "
"previous by creating multiple signatures with varying quotes, styles, and "
"information."
msgstr ""
"As sinaturas aleatorias collen sinaturas ao chou do ficheiro de sinaturas do "
"&ksig;. Pode facer que cada mensaxe de correo sexa máis interesante e única "
"que a anterior creando varias sinaturas con diversas citas, estilos e "
"información."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Daily signatures will pull signatures from the &ksig; signature file only "
"using one signature for an entire day. Every day will provide a different "
"signature, and just like the random signatures provide uniqueness to your "
"emails."
msgstr ""
"As sinaturas diarias collen sinaturas do ficheiro de sinaturas de &ksig; "
"empregando unha sinatura para cada día completo. Cada día fornece unha "
"sinatura distinta e, igual que as sinaturas aleatorias, fan que as mensaxes "
"sexan únicas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please report any problems or feature requests to the &kde; mailing lists."
msgstr ""
"Informe dos problemas e peticións de características novas nas listas de "
"correo de &kde;."

